{
  "video_id": "4ETZ1PzWQ20",
  "title": "👉 The Polite Way to Ask 'Again?' in Spanish #Shorts",
  "updated_at": "2026-11-19 20:50:06",
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.22,
      "end": 3.339,
      "en": "Mi amiga llamó a una oficina ayer por\ntrabajo.",
      "zh": "我朋友昨天打電話到辦公室詢問工作。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 3.98,
      "end": 7.11,
      "en": "Preguntó si recibieron sus documentos,",
      "zh": "她問對方有沒有收到文件，"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 7.11,
      "end": 8.32,
      "en": "pero le dijeron que no.",
      "zh": "她問對方有沒有收到文件，\n結果對方說沒有。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 8.929,
      "end": 10.89,
      "en": "Entonces preguntó:",
      "zh": "她就問："
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 10.89,
      "end": 12.199,
      "en": "'¿Estás seguro?'",
      "zh": "她就問：\n「你確定嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 12.199,
      "end": 13.48,
      "en": "y el hombre se molestó.",
      "zh": "她就問：\n「你確定嗎？」\n結果對方突然很不高興。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 14.199,
      "end": 15.63,
      "en": "Él respondió:",
      "zh": "對方回說："
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 15.63,
      "end": 16.82,
      "en": "'¿Perdón?',",
      "zh": "對方回說：\n「你說什麼？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 16.82,
      "end": 18.079,
      "en": "¡mi amiga se sintió fatal!",
      "zh": "對方回說：\n「你說什麼？」\n我朋友當時真的超尷尬的！"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 19.26,
      "end": 21.14,
      "en": "¡Ya sé por qué!",
      "zh": "我知道為什麼！"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 21.14,
      "end": 22.579,
      "en": "Gramaticalmente está bien,",
      "zh": "我知道為什麼！\n文法上沒錯，"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 22.579,
      "end": 23.579,
      "en": "pero suena mal.",
      "zh": "我知道為什麼！\n文法上沒錯，\n但在職場聽起來很刺耳。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 24.37,
      "end": 28.39,
      "en": "Suena como si pensaras que la otra persona\nmiente o es descuidada.",
      "zh": "聽起來好像你在質疑對方說謊，"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 29.41,
      "end": 30.37,
      "en": "¿En serio?",
      "zh": "聽起來好像你在質疑對方說謊，\n或是覺得對方辦事不力。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 30.37,
      "end": 33.02,
      "en": "¡Ella solo quería que revisara otra vez!",
      "zh": "真的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 33.67,
      "end": 35.679,
      "en": "¿Qué debería haber dicho en su lugar?",
      "zh": "真的嗎？\n她只是想請對方再確認一次而已耶！"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 35.56,
      "end": 38.85,
      "en": "Hay dos frases educadas.",
      "zh": "那她該怎麼說才對？"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 38.85,
      "end": 40.179,
      "en": "Primero:",
      "zh": "有兩個禮貌的說法。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 40.179,
      "end": 41.38,
      "en": "'¿Podrías revisar de nuevo,",
      "zh": "有兩個禮貌的說法。\n第一句："
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 41.38,
      "end": 41.899,
      "en": "por favor?",
      "zh": "有兩個禮貌的說法。\n第一句：\n「可以麻煩你再確認一下嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 43.03,
      "end": 46.109,
      "en": "¿Podrías revisar de nuevo?'",
      "zh": "「可以麻煩你再確認一下嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 46.109,
      "end": 47.679,
      "en": "Suena mucho más amable.",
      "zh": "「可以麻煩你再確認一下嗎？」\n這聽起來溫和多了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "start": 48.74,
      "end": 49.96,
      "en": "¿Cuál es la segunda opción?",
      "zh": "那第二個方法是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "start": 50.89,
      "end": 53.74,
      "en": "Usa 'double check' con una razón.",
      "zh": "試試看用「double-check」，"
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "start": 54.729,
      "end": 55.369,
      "en": "Di:",
      "zh": "試試看用「double-check」，\n並給出一個理由。"
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "start": 55.369,
      "end": 57.619,
      "en": "'Mi cliente dice que lo envió,",
      "zh": "你可以說："
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "start": 57.619,
      "end": 59.039,
      "en": "¿podrías verificarlo por mí?",
      "zh": "你可以說：\n「客戶說已經寄出了，"
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "start": 59.899,
      "end": 61.31,
      "en": "Double check',",
      "zh": "你可以說：\n「客戶說已經寄出了，\n能幫我再確認一下嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "start": 61.31,
      "end": 63.82,
      "en": "eso significa revisar una vez más,",
      "zh": "「Double-check」就是再檢查一次的意思，"
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "start": 63.82,
      "end": 64.379,
      "en": "¿cierto?",
      "zh": "「Double-check」就是再檢查一次的意思，\n對吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "start": 65.629,
      "end": 66.859,
      "en": "¡Exacto!",
      "zh": "沒錯！"
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "start": 66.859,
      "end": 68.54,
      "en": "Y para ser más educado,",
      "zh": "沒錯！\n如果想更有禮貌，"
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "start": 68.54,
      "end": 70.43,
      "en": "empieza con un 'disculpa'.",
      "zh": "沒錯！\n如果想更有禮貌，\n開頭可以先說聲不好意思。"
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "start": 71.319,
      "end": 72.359,
      "en": "Di:",
      "zh": "你可以說："
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "start": 72.359,
      "end": 73.739,
      "en": "'Perdona la molestia,",
      "zh": "你可以說：\n「抱歉打擾了，"
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "start": 73.739,
      "end": 75.18,
      "en": "¿podrías revisar una vez más?",
      "zh": "你可以說：\n「抱歉打擾了，\n可以麻煩你再確認一次嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "start": 75.92,
      "end": 78.04,
      "en": "Eso es súper seguro.",
      "zh": "這招超保險的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "start": 78.04,
      "end": 79.129,
      "en": "Entonces,",
      "zh": "這招超保險的。\n那黃金準則是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "start": 79.129,
      "end": 80.54,
      "en": "¿cuál es la regla de oro?",
      "zh": "黃金準則："
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "start": 82.01,
      "end": 84.219,
      "en": "Regla de oro:",
      "zh": "黃金準則：\n在職場上絕對不要說「Are you sure?」。"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "start": 84.219,
      "end": 86.15,
      "en": "nunca digas 'Are you sure?'",
      "zh": "改用「Could you check again?」或「Could you double-check?」會更好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "start": 86.15,
      "end": 87.359,
      "en": "en el trabajo.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "start": 88.709,
      "end": 90.319,
      "en": "Usa mejor:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "start": 90.319,
      "end": 92.459,
      "en": "'¿Podrías revisar de nuevo?'",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "start": 92.459,
      "end": 94.819,
      "en": "o '¿Podrías hacer un double check?",
      "zh": ""
    }
  ]
}